    <comment>Update to 0.9.51

Fix-only release: shrink guard, --force --code-only rescan, hyperedge
remap, Leiden endpoint canonicalization, TS/JS new Foo() call edges,
Elixir when-guards, Common Lisp node-id collisions. 3970 tests pass.</comment>
