    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>Update to 0.9.52

Upstream bugfix-only release (13 fixes): Markdown wikilinks to
semantic-backed documents survive a code-only rebuild, T-SQL routines
that parse to ERROR nodes are recovered, PHP object-creation calls
edges, inherited field-type receiver resolution, Objective-C field
table remap across id rewrites, TypeScript type-only imports no longer
fake import cycles, and the MCP prs/get_node tools report failures and
resolve nodes consistently.

No dependency, licence or packaging change: the only spec edit is the
Version: line. Built natively on aarch64, 4023 tests pass per flavour
(python313/python314), rpmlint 0 errors / 0 badness.</comment>
